  "html": "<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Algors4.jpg\" title=\"Image:Algors4.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Algors4.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"323\" src=\"/images/Algors4.jpg\" width=\"731\"/></a><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th><i>Dungeon Levels</i>\n</th><th><b>Layout</b>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Attack to Use</i>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Algor's Terror Dome L 1-4</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland</a>\n</td><td>Fire Mutants\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><b>Ice</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Subterrorania</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest</a>\n</td><td>Ice Orok\n</td><td>Snow Wargs\n</td><td><b>Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Arborgeddon</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest</a>\n</td><td>Ice Oroks\n</td><td>Snow Wargs\n</td><td><b>Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Haterium</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest</a>\n</td><td>Ice Oroks\n</td><td>Snow Wargs\n</td><td><b>Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Algor's Terror Dome L 5-7</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest</a>\n</td><td>Ice Oroks\n</td><td>Snow Wargs\n</td><td><b>Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Grave Forge</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Plague Plant</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>   ---\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Abyss Mill</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Fades\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><b>Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b> ** Lair of the Snow Chieftain</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Fields_Layout\" title=\"Ice Fields Layout\">Special Ice Fields</a>\n</td><td>Ice Oroks\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><b>Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Algor's Terror Dome is recommended for characters from Level 10 to 25.  It is the third dungeon in the normal sequence, following <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>. It is accessible through <a href=\"/wiki/Algors_Terror_Dome_Base_Camp\" title=\"Algors Terror Dome Base Camp\">Algors Terror Dome Base Camp</a>. It is named for the <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Chieftain\" title=\"Snow Chieftain\">Snow Chieftain</a>, Algor the Cold, whose lair is after Level 7.  The name is a parody of former vice president Albert Gore, a conservationist famous for his interest in the Arctic icefields.</b>\n</p>\n<a name=\"DUNGEON_DETAILS\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>DUNGEON DETAILS</b></span></h1>\n<a name=\"Level_1\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 1</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Fire Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Fire Mutant Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pincer\" title=\"Mutant Pincer\">Fire Mutant Pincers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Twins\" title=\"Mutant Twins\">Fire Mutant Twins</a>. Subterrorania is located off Level 1\n</p>\n<a name=\"Subterrorania\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Subterrorania</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_2\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 2</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Fire Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Fire Mutant Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pincer\" title=\"Mutant Pincer\">Fire Mutant Pincers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Mutant_Twins\" title=\"Fire Mutant Twins\">Fire Mutant Twins</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_3\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 3</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Fire Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Fire Mutant Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pincer\" title=\"Mutant Pincer\">Fire Mutant Pincers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Twins\" title=\"Mutant Twins\">Fire Mutant Twins</a>. \n</p>\n<a name=\"Arborgeddon\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Arborgeddon</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_4\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 4</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Fire Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Fire Mutant Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Pincer\" title=\"Mutant Pincer\">Fire Mutant Pincers</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Mutant_Twins\" title=\"Fire Mutant Twins\">Fire Mutant Twins</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Haterium\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Haterium</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_5\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 5</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p><p>Grave Forge is located off Level 5.  There is also a portal to <a href=\"/wiki/Vexation_Station\" title=\"Vexation Station\">Vexation Station</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Grave_Forge\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Grave Forge</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Shadow Fade Lichlord\">Shadow Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_General\" title=\"Shadow Fade General\">Shadow Fade Generals</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Desperado!\" title=\"Shadow Fade Desperado!\">Shadow Fade Desperado!s</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Crusher\" title=\"Bone Crusher\">Bone Crushers</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_6\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 6</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>.Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_7\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 7</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Forest_Layout\" title=\"Ice Forest Layout\">Ice Forest Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Ice Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juggernaut\" title=\"Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Snow Wargs</a>.\n</p><p>Abyss Mill, Plague Plant and Lair of the Snow Chieftain are located off Level 7\n</p>\n<a name=\"Plague_Plant\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Plague Plant</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Factory_Worker\" title=\"Shadow Fade Factory Worker\">Shadow Fade Factory Workers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Disectoid\" title=\"Shadow Fade Disectoid\">Shadow Fade Disectoids</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Desperado!\" title=\"Shadow Fade Desperado!\">Shadow Fade Desperado!s</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Factory_Foremen\" title=\"Fade Factory Foremen\">Shadow Fade Factory Foremen</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Shadow Fade Lichlord\">Shadow Fade Lichlords</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Abyss_Mill\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Abyss Mill</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Factory_Worker\" title=\"Shadow Fade Factory Worker\">Shadow Fade Factory Workers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Disectoid\" title=\"Shadow Fade Disectoid\">Shadow Fade Disectoids</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Desperado!\" title=\"Shadow Fade Desperado!\">Shadow Fade Desperado!s</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Factory_Foremen\" title=\"Fade Factory Foremen\">Shadow Fade Factory Foremen</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Shadow Fade Lichlord\">Shadow Fade Lichlords</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Lair_of_the_Snow_Chieftain\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Lair of the Snow Chieftain</span></h1>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:200px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Algor.png\" title=\"The Snow Chieftain Algor the Cold, the Boss of Algor's Terror Dome\"><img alt=\"The Snow Chieftain Algor the Cold, the Boss of Algor's Terror Dome\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"203\" src=\"/images/recovered/Algor.png\" width=\"198\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Algor.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>The Snow Chieftain Algor the Cold, the Boss of Algor's Terror Dome</b></div></div></div>\n<p>Special <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Fields_Layout\" title=\"Ice Fields Layout\">Ice Fields Layout</a>. A linked series of 3 rooms. First room is 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Juggernaut\" title=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\">Ice Orok Juggernaut</a> champions and hordes of <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Ice Orok Spawn\">Ice Orok Spawn</a> fodder. The Second room is the same as the first. The last room is the same as the previous two, but with the addition of the <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Chieftain\" title=\"Snow Chieftain\">Snow Chieftain</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor_the_Cold\" title=\"Algor the Cold\">Algor the Cold</a>, as well. He hits very hard and knocks back a lot.  When he is defeated the Boss Door opens to a treasure room and a one-way portal to <a href=\"/wiki/Vexation_Station\" title=\"Vexation Station\">Vexation Station</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
